{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05322","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭 · 解琬","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主第簪裾出，王畿春照华。\n山亭一以眺，城阙带烟霞。\n横堤列锦帐，傍浦驻香车。\n欢娱属晦节，酩酊未还家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"解琬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}